chainDropColumn : Chain 3 1 base_1 (postDropColumn 3 1 base_1 usersTbl users_name)
chainDropColumn = snoc 3 1 base_1 base_1 (postDropColumn 3 1 base_1 usersTbl users_name) (nil 3 1 base_1) (dropColumn 3 1 base_1 usersTbl users_name refl)

